            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nad tarif"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On platform.openai.com open Usage, then Export. Activity data has tokens. Cost data has dollars. Or create an Admin key under Organization settings. A normal API key cannot read usage. Tokeny sends the key only to api.openai.com.": {
      "localizations": {
        "cs": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Na platform.openai.com otevři Usage a pak Export. Activity data mají tokeny. Cost data mají dolary. Nebo vytvoř admin klíč v nastavení organizace. Běžný klíč k API využití nepřečte. Tokeny ho posílají jen na api.openai.com."
          }
        }
      }
    },
